Description: add configurable SD card identity and PCI SDHCI boot priority
 Expose an optional SD card CID while preserving the default identities, card
 protocol and migration state. Add per-controller bootindex for firmware boot
 ordering without changing the default response format. Cover card identity,
 capacity boundaries, I/O, reset and invalid configuration with native qtests.
 Document the card model, capacity limits and firmware compatibility.
Forwarded: no

